  "decision_conditions": [
    "<div style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; line-height: 20px;\">The proposed flue, by reason of the absence of sufficient information demonstrating that its operation would not result in unacceptable levels of noise, vibration and odour, has not been shown to avoid harm to the living conditions of nearby residential occupiers. The proposal therefore has the potential to result in an undue adverse impact on neighbouring amenity and is contrary to Policies D12.3 and D12.4 of the Merton Local Plan (2024), which seek to ensure that development does not unacceptably diminish the living conditions of existing and future occupiers.</div>"
